{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113021795766812672"]}, "author_id": "2104252259613765632", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:37:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113021907024929206"], "id": "2113021907024929206", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 143, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108204467774509059", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I LEFT 6 AI AGENTS ALONE WITH MY PORTFOLIO FOR A WHOLE MARKET DAY. THEY WERE ALLOWED TO TEXT ME ONCE. THEY USED IT AT 13:47\n\nGROK BOT + HAIKU 5.5 + JEV + OPUS 5.5 + OPENAI DOTS + OBSIDIAN\n\n6 tools. 1 desk. 0 buy buttons\n\n\u2192 obsidian is the memory. why i own each of my 14 stocks, https://t.co/IdaImtAvv4 https://t.co/YaH928foLv", "url": "https://x.com/xinc3s/status/2113021907024929206"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113018704925696000"]}, "author_id": "1445084903146614791", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:24:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113018710747476271"], "id": "2113018710747476271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 324, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "WAIT, WHAT?!\n\ngrok bot in august.\nopenai dots in september.\nand now anthropic drops claude duet, built on opus 5.5.\n\nwe go to sleep, wake up and there's ANOTHER always on AI agent.\n\nthe agent war is officially ON. https://t.co/TfBWlgptgE https://t.co/0PfVItoPrJ", "url": "https://x.com/liebert_2026/status/2113018710747476271"}, {"article": {"title": "Claude Duet cannot trade stocks or move your money. Here is what it can do, and what it costs"}, "author_id": "1563266793900474368", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:37:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113006805043249551"], "id": "2113006805043249551", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/WNLUeVbaGh", "url": "https://x.com/klaivor/status/2113006805043249551"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112982862186106880"]}, "author_id": "1289980460244713473", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:29:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113004669001748685"], "id": "2113004669001748685", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 383, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Claude just killed personal agents.\n\nClaude launched Claude Duets, it's reply to grok @bot &amp; OpenAI Dots.\n\n- Built on the best model Opus 5.5\n- Is a proactive agent\n- Is in research preview only in US \n- available on Pro &amp; Max plan https://t.co/v18ORMi8k5", "url": "https://x.com/Screeendev/status/2113004669001748685"}, {"author_id": "1709245282553053185", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:17:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113001836026397168"], "id": "2113001836026397168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 148, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Anthropic officially put their feet into it. \n\n\u2022\u2022Claude Duet vs Grok Bot vs OpenAI Dots.\n\n-(One is built to be careful) , (one is built to be useful(, and( one is built to just\u2026 do stuff) \n\nWhich one would you actually let touch your calendar and inbox?\u201d https://t.co/l8OwTdbXyC", "url": "https://x.com/adityaa_behera/status/2113001836026397168"}, {"author_id": "64569691", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:12:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113000551483162923"], "id": "2113000551483162923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 500, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "anthropic going all out\n\nwe all know this is gonna be better than openAI dots and grok bot\n\ni run 5 grok bots right now. they scan X for posts worth replying to, people to connect with, and one of them sends me a brief every morning\n\nClaude Duet can do all of that. it gets its https://t.co/YwLw5ekF93", "url": "https://x.com/anytwocardzz/status/2113000551483162923"}, {"author_id": "2079185418936078336", "created_at": "2026-10-21T20:05:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112998702340358431"], "id": "2112998702340358431", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 140, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112990042662871382", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude Duet vs ChatGPT Dots...\n\n&gt;included with Claude Pro and Max during the research preview; shares your plan\u2019s usage limits\ninitially available through a US-only waitlist\n&gt;built on Opus 5.5; Dots uses GPT-6 Astra\n&gt;has its own VM and browser \u2014 Dots also has a cloud computer https://t.co/nxhzXM3hnR", "url": "https://x.com/potato_compute/status/2112998702340358431"}, {"author_id": "1828475904818921472", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:30:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112990042662871382"], "id": "2112990042662871382", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 426, "impression_count": 144548, "like_count": 1249, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 35}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Claude just killed ChatGPT Dots...\n\n&gt; included with Claude Pro (Dots needs $100/mo ChatGPT Pro)\n&gt; built on Opus 5.5 aka the best model in the world\n&gt; has its own VM and browser\n&gt; access to over 6,000 connectors (Dots: 4,000)\n&gt; works while your laptop is off\n&gt; sends you a morning https://t.co/DvofD3qLfZ", "url": "https://x.com/Layton_Gott/status/2112990042662871382"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112984627849895936"]}, "author_id": "101805159", "created_at": "2026-10-21T19:09:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112984630320382418"], "id": "2112984630320382418", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 3533, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112919360708976878", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "An AI agent got a $250 delay credit out of Delta for one person. Another one cancelled $1,300 a month in subscriptions its owner forgot about. Then I saw the ranking of all nine of these agents built on what users say in public, and the one I use every day came in 6th.\n\nMeta\u2019s https://t.co/onW6j4CQYd https://t.co/xPuyyoKQqf", "url": "https://x.com/aakashgupta/status/2112984630320382418"}, {"author_id": "529464057", "created_at": "2026-10-21T18:07:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112968957582020778"], "id": "2112968957582020778", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2006, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112919360708976878", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "AI demos show you what a product can do. Real users tell you what it's actually like.\n\nThat's what makes @feedbackbench interesting. \n\nIts Personal Agents rankings launch today, placing Muse first and ChatGPT Dots eighth among nine agents.\n\nIt's built by @enterpret_ai, which https://t.co/Wb5BkHQn0r", "url": "https://x.com/AIHighlight/status/2112968957582020778"}, {"author_id": "1662868113782612054", "created_at": "2026-10-21T15:49:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112934378997223873"], "id": "2112934378997223873", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1662868113782612054", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112933837814571104", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Sources (sizes only, not per-core speed; checked Oct 20, 2026):\nGrok Bot: measured on my account, Oct 20, 2026 